gostls is a pure-Go TLS 1.2 client. It is BSD-2-Clause and links no GPL code.
Its GOST cryptographic primitives come from github.com/bigbes/gostcrypto (also
BSD-2-Clause); it additionally depends on filippo.io/bigmod and
golang.org/x/crypto. None of these is GPL.

gostls is the pure-Go backend for the go-tlsdialer-shaped dialer; the
alternative cgo OpenSSL backend lives in that separate dialer module, not here.
